 around it so your environment  plays a crucial role in breaking your  bad habits if food is your weakness then  avoid buying and stocking up on junk  food this will reduce the chances of you  mindlessly grabbing something out of the  fridge and start binging if  try to quit smoking or drinking then  hanging out at a bar would not help okay  avoid places that would trigger you to  drink or smoke and if you're used to  drive thrus then change your route and  avoid driving through that same location  every day so take a look at how your  current environment is feeding your bad  habits  ask yourself what small changes can I do  right now step number six use habit  reminders have been reminders are a  great way to keep up with your new  routines the whole idea is to be hyper  aware especially when you're about to  fall back into your same old habits for  example when I tried to create biting my  nails I applied a nail polish because it  is absolutely disgusting to bite your  nails with nail polish on and it totally  worked and when I wanted to go to bed  earlier I set a daily reminder on my  phone at 11:00 p.m. to remind myself to  start winding down and if you have the  bad habit of eating mindlessly out of  your fridge then put a huge note on your  fridge to remind yourself to stop doing  it  these reminders might seem silly to  begin with but it's a great way for you  to be hyper aware of your habit change  the next step is to commit publicly when  you declare you goes publicly you are  more accountable in a way you have set a  challenge for yourself to succeed not  only to prove it to yourself but to  others which can be a huge motivation so  go ahead tell your friends tell your  family members join an online community  post your progress online and even leave  your comments below on my channel okay  don't just tell us once keep us updated  on a regular basis next be kind to  yourself you have probably gone through  the what the hell scenario so imagine  this oh my 